WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.950
Kimberly answers Ryu’s incoming Drive Impact.

2
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:05.250
The winning DI creates the Punish Counter crumple.

3
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.950
